+         * -- and 0008's hardened repair commits the page. The module stops
+         * claiming a fault it was never able to fix.
+         *
+         * **What it cannot regress:** on the working SMC path the reprotect
+         * succeeds and this never runs, so a guest that works today cannot be
+         * depending on it -- reaching this line and working are mutually
+         * exclusive. What it does change is the shape of a genuine failure: a
+         * hang becomes an access violation with an address in it. The one loss
+         * I can construct is a real SMC page transiently unprotectable through a
